    <rdfs:label>e-index</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>An h-index complement, aimed at considering the contributions of excess citations, which are mainly from highly cited papers. It is necessary, especially for evaluating highly cited scientists or for precisely comparing the scientific output of a group of scientists having an identical h-index.</rdfs:comment>
